  "id": "sdo",
  "term": "SDO",
  "definition": "SDO refers to social dominance orientation: a person’s preference for inequality between social groups and support for group-based hierarchies. People high in SDO tend to see these differences as legitimate or natural and show more negative attitudes toward outgroups.",
